              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"1534469f516fa59978b4a95b4bdabba3dac8d63592fd67ae945a0a451edced3c\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope evidence\">\nProject: mobile app UI design for a fictional neighborhood plant-care service.\nBuyer: Elian Cruz\nSeller: Mira Santos, Philippines\nCurrency: EUR\n\nAgreed deliverables:\n- Design a welcome screen with a sign-in button.\n- Design a plant list screen with three sample plants.\n- Design a plant detail screen with care instructions and a watering schedule.\n- Design an account settings screen with notification controls.\n\nThe seller will supply static design files and a short handover note. The buyer will review the visual layouts; app development and coded functionality are not included. The agreed price for the four screens is EUR 480, payable through PayPal.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
